sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Vue
    participant A as Library API
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant F as Private storage
    participant R as Recovery
    U->>A: Multipart + actor-scoped Idempotency-Key
    A->>D: Reserve quota and upload operation
    A->>F: Bounded staging, digest, manifest, move
    A->>D: Commit READY assets and charged usage
    alt Commit succeeds
        A-->>U: 201 or replay200
    else IO or DB failure
        A-->>U: Safe error, no false success
        R->>D: Lock expired operation and recheck references
        R->>F: Reconcile only unreferenced library keys
        R->>D: Finalize or compensate reservation
    end
